# Worktree-isolated agent checkouts. A nested copy under .claude/worktrees/agent-*/ does not
# match the path-anchored rules below (web/src/tokens.css, the ideas-review.html dashboard),
# so `prettier --check .` fails on files that are correctly ignored at their real location.
# Stated here rather than left to Prettier's .gitignore fallback, which is a CLI default.
.claude/worktrees/
# Committed scrapbook run outputs (ADR-0059) are generated/promoted output, not
# hand-authored source — the index.html and any published HTML/CSS/JS reports
# must not be reformatted. scrapbook/README.md is dprint-owned via *.md below.
scrapbook/
# Verbatim run output retained under docs/scratchpad/ (ADR-0059) — the bytes a
# tool emitted, kept as written so a later reader sees what the run actually
# produced. Named per tree rather than as the whole folder: hand-authored probes
# beside them (popover-probe/) are maintained source and stay in Prettier's
# scope. The notes are Markdown, dprint-owned via *.md below.
